# Shared backend for the deployed portal.
#
# These two values are meant to be public. The "anon" key is Supabase's
# publishable client key: on its own it grants nothing. Every PSC table has
# row-level security that checks the signed-in user's email against the
# psc_members roster, so a stranger who signs up sees no committee data.
#
# Never put the service_role key here — that one does bypass row-level security.
